	"title"		"MpConfigSync (主机配置自动下发 / Host Config Sync)"
	"description"		"[h1]MpConfigSync(主机配置自动下发)[/h1]

联机开局时,主机自动把全部 mod 配置推送给每一位队友,从根源上消除两端配置不同导致的联机分歧.

[i]At multiplayer run start, the host automatically pushes all mod config values to every peer - eliminating the state-divergence class caused by mismatched local config files.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]它解决什么问题 / The problem[/h2]

杀戮尖塔 2 的联机采用逐动作校验和比对:两端游戏状态有任何不同就会触发 State Divergence 断线.mod 的设置项存在各自电脑的本地配置文件里 - 同一间房里,主机开了某个开关而队友没开,同一个事件选项就会在两端解析成完全不同的效果,直接炸档.

真实案例:主机开了 Acts from the Past 的均衡模式(RebalancedMode),队友没开 - 吸血鬼事件里所有人点了同一个选项,主机端人人获得鲜血储蓄袋,队友端什么都没有,当场分歧断线.

[h2]工作方式 / How it works[/h2]

[list]
[*]主机在联机开局瞬间快照本机全部 mod 配置,通过 BaseLib 自定义消息通道推送给所有队友
[*]三个发送时机互相兜底:新建开局 / 读档建房 / 引擎 InitializeShared 兜底,确保先于首个随机消费者
[*]队友端整包校验后[b]仅写入内存[/b] - 本局立即与主机一致
[*][b]配置文件被冻结保护[/b]:会话期间队友的 cfg 文件绝不改写;对局结束或断线时自动恢复原字节
[*]未安装的 mod / 不认识的配置项自动跳过,永不崩溃
[/list]

[h2]使用方法 / Usage[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]两端都订阅本 mod[/b](消息必须两端都能解析)
[*]设置 -> Mod 设置 -> MpConfigSync -> 启用联机配置同步(默认开启)
[*]之后正常联机即可 - 开局自动完成,无需任何操作;主机的值只在会话内生效,退出后队友本地设置原样不变
[/list]

[i]Both host and every peer must subscribe. Enable in Settings -> Mod Settings -> MpConfigSync (on by default). Then just play - the sync happens automatically at run start.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]前置依赖 / Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]必须[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737335127]BaseLib[/url]
[/list]

[b]重要 - BaseLib 版本提示 / Important - BaseLib version note[/b]

创意工坊的 BaseLib 更新经常落后于官方 GitHub.游戏版本更新后,如果工坊版 BaseLib 报错或本 mod 无法加载,请前往 GitHub 下载最新版:
[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/Alchyr/BaseLib-StS2/releases]GitHub Releases(推荐 / recommended)[/url] - 最新正式版
[*]安装方法:下载 zip,解压到 [code]Slay the Spire 2/mods/[/code],并[b]取消订阅工坊版 BaseLib[/b](避免双加载)
[/list]

[i]The Workshop BaseLib often lags behind the official GitHub. If BaseLib errors after a game update, grab the latest release from GitHub (link above), unzip into the mods folder, and unsubscribe from the Workshop copy to avoid double-loading.[/i]"
	"changenote"		"v0.1.1: sync protocol rework (2026-09-12 review) - host pushes the config snapshot from the lobbies and on rejoin BEFORE begin-run traffic (reliable ordered channel), so it applies before the first deterministic consumer; receiver authenticates the sender as the transport-level host (clients only; hosts/SP reject); touched cfg files are frozen read-only during the session and restored byte-exact at cleanup (crash-safe, no preference pollution); snapshots are fully validated before atomic apply, with wire-size bounds."
	"publishedfileid"		"3799210379"
